---
import Studio from '../layouts/Studio.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
---
<Studio title="做点好玩的" desc="亲手调整起伏与视角，把一个平面变成另一种形状；继续探索图形实验和小游戏。"><main class="as-wrap as-page"><div class="as-page-head"><div class="as-eyebrow">LESS TALK, MORE PLAY</div><h1>让一个小想法，动起来。</h1><p>调整起伏与视角，看平面如何长成另一种形状。</p></div><section class="as-play-layout" data-surface aria-label="交互曲面实验"><div class="as-play-stage"><canvas id="surface-canvas" aria-label="可调整起伏和视角的波浪曲面">使用下面的滑块调整曲面起伏和观察角度。</canvas><span class="as-stage-caption">SURFACE STUDY / 形状的可能性</span></div><div class="as-play-controls"><h2>一片起伏的空间</h2><p>没有标准答案。<br/>试试你喜欢的形状。</p><label for="surface-wave"><span>起伏程度<output id="surface-wave-value" for="surface-wave">55</output></span><input id="surface-wave" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="55"/></label><label for="surface-angle"><span>观察角度<output id="surface-angle-value" for="surface-angle">35°</output></span><input id="surface-angle" type="range" min="15" max="65" value="35"/></label><div class="as-mode-buttons" aria-label="曲面显示模式"><button type="button" data-surface-mode="lines" aria-pressed="true">线条</button><button type="button" data-surface-mode="dots" aria-pressed="false">点阵</button></div><button type="button" class="as-text-link" data-surface-reset>重新开始<Icon name="reset"/></button></div></section><div class="as-bottom-note"><p><b>从观察开始理解。</b><br/>把抽象的概念，变成可以亲手调整的东西。</p><a class="as-text-link" href="/posts/nanite-lod-selection/">读一篇几何笔记<Icon name="arrow-right"/></a></div><section class="studio-explore-links" aria-label="继续探索"><a href="/lab/"><span>图形实验室</span><p>粒子、光照、流体、布料与渲染管线。</p><Icon/></a><a href="/extras/"><span>游戏与放松</span><p>小游戏、音乐电台、茶歇与放空。</p><Icon/></a><a href="/standalone/babel/index.html"><span>巴别塔</span><p>用单词爬塔的卡牌游戏。</p><Icon/></a></section></main></Studio>
<script>import '../scripts/surface.js';</script>
